k at big  companies and they'll be moving up in  the ranks and you'll have contacts and  friends to be able to talk business with  potentially sell to down the line so you  can make a lot of great connections from  joining an MBA program that you might  want to think about as well so those are  on my personal thoughts I'd like to turn  it over to Jeff Ogden a friend of mine  from  new customers to get his perspective as  well  so the question was asked is spending  $100,000 for an MBA really worth it  well my and actually I don't have an MBA  I decided not to get one but I really  think the answer is a qualified maybe  because there's really three things you  get from an MBA you get knowledge so  you've got two years of learning from  some excellent professors you've got  skills that you're going to develop over  that time and you've got networking  because you're the alumni network has a  lot of value in addition there's an  intangible value that is a prestige that  comes from a prestigious school so you  know there are benefits that come from  it however it's a big expense and the  thing you've got you got to say is can I  get that on my own for instance I don't  have an MBA but I have a winter  prestigious undergrad school Notre Dame  I accumulated massive amounts of skills  over the 30 years since I've graduated a  tree accumulated tremendous knowledge in  fact my content is taught in the MBA  program there and I don't have an MBA so  can you do it without spending a hundred  thousand dollars yes you can but it  takes a long time so if you've got the  money and you want to move fast  get your MBA but if you're tight on  money and you don't owe and you're not  in a huge rush then do do it on your own  you don't need to go to school I hope  that helps so while I hope that was  useful hope my thoughts were helpful and  Jeff's thoughts as well if you guys  liked the video please give it a thumbs  up below and I also love to hear  thoughts on getting an MBA program if  you want to leave a comment under the  video and stay tuned for next episode
 

